.\" M4KK1 4P1 - passwd.8
.TH PASSWD 8 "2026-07-22" "M4KK1 1.0" "M4KK1 System Administration"
.SH NAME
passwd \- change user password
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B passwd
[\fIusername\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a user's password. Without arguments, change the current user's password. Specifying a username requires prime group membership. Passwords are hashed with SHA-256 + salt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR usermod (8),
.BR quell (8),
.BR login.conf (5)
